    "description": {
      "value": "This coin-sized metal disk is inscribed with arcane symbols and mounted on the inner surface of a shield. When you Activate the disk, the triggering weapon momentarily sticks to your shield, allowing you to attempt to Disarm it from its wielder with a +2 item bonus. If you roll a critical failure on this check, you get a failure instead.\n\nActivate (Free Action); Components envision; Trigger You use the affixed shield to Shield Block a melee weapon attack; Requirements You are an expert in Athletics."
